{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "02afa328a2da49c482cb407673b7b93eb9feaacb3d9454eed9d10252ac2c1986", "ja": "（エレナのステージが無事に終了。ダンスに合わせて\n舞う桜の花びらの演出に、大盛り上がりだったな！）", "zh": "（艾琳娜的表演顺利结束了。\n樱花花瓣随着舞步飞舞的特效，让气氛很热烈呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "39bd0793365a409cc5979ffb35b30dcde66d5a04baf65da88114c10052e96feb", "ja": "お疲れさまだヨ～、{$P$}。\nワタシのステージ見ててくれた？", "zh": "辛苦你了喔～{$P$}。\n你有看我的表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b105364f039d5bb57ebd946bf9de3cd0436fdb5e1e1c888a68c778a0a6e9a1b3", "ja": "お疲れさまエレナ。もちろん見てたよ。レッスンの\n時より、ずっといい動きだったんじゃないか？", "zh": "艾琳娜，辛苦啦。我当然有看啊。\n感觉你的动作好像比训练时还要流畅很多？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "b600fa2930daae0373979ce34080a51d9c648f34c66e15862646dc148067f37b", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　やっぱりお客さんの前だと体が勝手に\n動いちゃうよネ！　ワタシ、上手に踊れてたかナ？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪在观众面前，身体就是会自己动起来呢！\n我有跳得很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a74779969f7afca2d68e6c9d3c28432d3d0f3de98eead381382690ae06f09f64", "ja": "ファンのみんなも、エレナと一緒に踊りだしちゃった\nくらいだからな。ばっちり踊れてたと思うよ。", "zh": "好到甚至连粉丝们都跟着艾琳娜一起跳了呢。\n我觉得你跳得非常棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "bad21c1289ec2132bed96b49db5ad29212d9b20f6aed18c2dcfc20c0166d30b4", "ja": "そうなノ！　今日のお客さん、ノリがよかったよネ。\nみんなで一緒に踊れて、ワタシも最高だったヨ♪", "zh": "就是啊！今天的观众配合度超高耶。\n可以跟大家一起跳舞，我也觉得超棒的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "0a5edae30c9dff6d96ec19847dd12bebf8f54dc3fdf69ef70251bb13676b2b7e", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}も、\nライブを見ながら、ワタシと一緒に踊ってくれたノ？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}那你呢？\n你看演唱会时，也有和我一起跳舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d92609327dfa26ecd5c1b6f56a92078dca5869595c06e215680ba754cb99baec", "ja": "ああ。エレナと一緒にリズムと一体になれて、とっても\n楽しかったぞ。じつはまだ、気分はノリノリだしな。", "zh": "嗯，能和艾琳娜一起和节奏融为一体，真的很开心。\n其实我到现在情绪还是很亢奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "9446c3d8d4c6e7ff9effe77cde96962919d25b04c52c6d9a82cf5f6aa8708e7c", "ja": "ホント？　やったー♪　{$P$}も\nお客さんもノリノリなら、ライブは大成功だネ♪", "zh": "真的吗？耶～♪{$P$}和观众都很嗨，\n那演唱会就算是大大成功了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "0147289c6be35193d927f407c6972695a313961a7c94014ebe149201046ef40f", "ja": "あ、そうだ{$P$}、\nちょっと一緒に、こっちに来て？", "zh": "啊，对了，{$P$}。\n你跟我一起来这边一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c878c58abc70b6a2b29e32da02420a067265cd372ea6b0724958e4789d39df11", "ja": "エレナ？　ど、どこに行くんだ！？", "zh": "艾琳娜？要、要去哪里啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cb49aeb1f2a87ae08d58c735f40dbaee9c38f54cbacca88a1c3584202673ae95", "ja": "おいおい、お花見なら着替えてからでも遅くないぞ？\n桜が見たいなら、帰り道にでも……。", "zh": "喂喂，要赏花的话，先换完衣服也不嫌晚吧？\n如果想看樱花，在回家路上也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "81b7cabd92a87afc7d227f8bca2e71a7d4f80c94dd16376a31e934e9adc6a27f", "ja": "違うノ！　あのね、{$P$}も一緒に\n踊ってくれたの、ワタシ、見れなかったから……。", "zh": "不是啦！因为啊，{$P$}也有一起跳，\n可是我却没能看见你跳舞的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "e3898878cfc6356e2ffbe6905ed17776bc937e3cab6ae1195567367ad168c5f1", "ja": "今から、ふたりだけのステージがしたいノ！\nねっ、一緒に踊ろうヨ～♪", "zh": "所以我现在想举办只有两个人的表演！\n来，一起跳舞嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "22e6a0798c24c9836f5f60cb646311ab0dc2d2e94b1c60f5459b6ca77f1d067a", "ja": "はは、なるほど……。でも、俺は上手に踊れないと\n思うけど、いいのか？", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此……\n不过，我想我应该跳得不太好，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "569ca38143b49104328edd475a120404b56faf0668623d5600dc45b8cd4c7e05", "ja": "そんなの関係ないヨ！\n心と体がリズムで繋がるのが、とっても楽しいノ！", "zh": "跟那没有关系！\n用节奏把身心连结在一起，是件很开心的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0064_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "4683a6faeffca01fb043aa00ef6ea40ae59bf1430aabac0858ac22bdb10b69e5", "ja": "じゃあ{$P$}？\n一緒に、レッツ、ダンシングだヨ～♪", "zh": "那么{$P$}，\n一起来Let's dancing啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
